{
 "data": {
  "uuid": "34077e67-5e2c-4903-a17c-2d0e163751c7",
  "name": "Vulture",
  "role": "Light Salvage",
  "msrp": 175,
  "description": {
   "en_EN": "Answer to no one, cut out the middle man, and throw caution to the wind. Rip wrecks like a pro and carve out your own place in the great big empty behind the stick of this rough, rugged salvage machine from Drake Interplanetary. ",
   "de_DE": "Antworte niemandem, schneide den Mittelsmann aus und warne vor dem Wind. Zerreißen Sie Wracks wie ein Profi und schnitzen Sie Ihren eigenen Platz in der großen leeren Halle hinter dem Steuerknüppel dieser rauen, robusten Bergungsmaschine von Drake Interplanetary heraus.",
   "zh_CN": "不对任何人负责，撇开中间人，将谨慎抛到九霄云外。你可以像专业人员一样打捞沉船，在德雷克星际公司生产的这台粗糙、坚固的打捞机器后面，在茫茫大海中开辟自己的天地。",
   "fr_FR": "Answer to no one, cut out the middle man, and throw caution to the wind. Rip wrecks like a pro and carve out your own place in the great big empty behind the stick of this rough, rugged salvage machine from Drake Interplanetary. "
  },
